# Godot text formats always diff as text with LF endings.
*.gd text eol=lf
*.tscn text eol=lf
*.tres text eol=lf
*.godot text eol=lf
*.cfg text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
# Binary assets are plain blobs for now. Moving them to Git LFS means a
# coordinated `git lfs migrate` across every open branch (see
# docs/FRAMEWORK.md, section 1), not a filter rule here.
